../../../docs/context/decision_log.md:576:- **Decision (Apurva):** the design-system review (`docs/reviews/2026-10-15-design-system-review.md`) is adopted. Common rules now live centrally in `design-system/RULES.md` §8.5–8.6 and **§9 (Components and states)** and `beyond-salt.md`: four button roles + call end, one button height per group, **48px tap targets**, chips wrap / one grid size, read-only rows, reserved tag width, status card, **one bottom-sheet template** (no drag handle), **dark toast** only where nothing on screen can show the result, edit-screen and viewer headers, states checklist, formats, accessibility, out of scope.
